{"id":394,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"少人数と英語・理数教育を重視する横浜富士見丘","feature_description":"横浜富士見丘学園中学校は、1学級約30名の少人数編成で、一人ひとりの特長をとらえながら自己肯定感や他者理解を育て、学習の基本姿勢を整えます。英語では語彙や文法の理解に加えて、英文に触れる量を増やす学びを実施。数学・理科は基礎知識を重視し、実験やデータの読み方・分析を扱う学習支援も行います。反復と少人数での支援を組み合わせ、基礎の定着を図ります。","clubs":[{"id":7379,"name":"バドミントン","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7380,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7381,"name":"ダンス(女子)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7382,"name":"チアリーディング","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7383,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7384,"name":"フットサル(男子)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7385,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7386,"name":"卓球(同好会)","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7387,"name":"ソフトボール(同好会)","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7388,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7389,"name":"科学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7390,"name":"軽音楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7391,"name":"家庭科","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":7392,"name":"茶道・華道","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fujimigaoka.ed.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":